[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0010","text":"我回来了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0020","text":"呼……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0030","text":"（想稍微放松一下\n　用一下这个吧）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0040","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0050","text":"（今天要做的事情……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0060","text":"（好像已经没什么了……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0070","text":"（……啊\n　衣服是不是得叠一下……？）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0080","text":"……哈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0090","text":"（……不过，好想再这样\n　待一会儿啊……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31600300_03_0100","text":"（明天再做吧……\n　衣服……）"}]
